    "managed_ship": "Any retained journey or durable travel receipt makes the existing server location authoritative. No expiry or inferred move back to an old destination.",
    "managed_player": "Check travel history across all ships linked to that shard player, so a different or new ship GUID cannot overwrite the player location.",
