    "compatibility": "Ships/players with no saved server travel history retain status initialization/external relocation behavior. Wallet updates stay independent. New, nested and legacy status forms covered.",
    "limitation": "Unversioned status cannot distinguish stale location from an intentional external relocation after travel. Such locations are preserved and require actual server travel or a separately designed explicit reconciliation mechanism.",
